    "Tokens and chat IDs are read only from environment variables.",
    "FRESH_WATCHER_* serves the 1 min and Fresher bot destinations.",
    "Existing TELEGRAM_DIGEST_5M_* and TELEGRAM_DIGEST_30M_* pairs serve the 5 min and 30 min destinations."
  ],
